      {
        "id": 143991,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-06T20:41:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Got it, played a game with AA, Nightmist, Ra, and Fanatic against Akash'bhuta in the Tomb. &nbsp;I was doing okay until an unlucky Oblivion knocked out the Adept, and then I lost Ra and Fanatic soon after. &nbsp;Spent some time tanking with Nightmist (and drawing lots of cards while Ensnaring Brambles kept her from dealing damage), until finally the Tomb was able to knock out the Brambles and I was able to go to town on her.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Then I went for maximum damage with AA, Visionary, Grampa Legacy, Ra, and Absolute Zero, but I wasn't able to catch a screenshot of Voss at -490 before it went to the victory screen, which doesn't show negative HPs. &nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_frowning_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_frowning_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_frowning_face:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 22,
        "post_type": 1,
