        "id": 143992,
        "name": "Pulseglazer",
        "username": "Pulseglazer",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/p/f04885/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-06T20:55:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Even though I have the ipad version, i decided not to wait and got it on steam too. Had a cakewalk against Ennead, lost to Apostate when I forgot to bring a damage clearer, then brought Soldier Bunker and it was cake. Had an epic with Akash In the old west. He wiped out my team before Nightmist did enough Nightmist things to finish him off.</p>",
