      {
        "id": 144002,
        "name": "danmarshall14",
        "username": "danmarshall14",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/danmarshall14/{size}/1944_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-08T04:42:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just christened Infernal Relics by destroying Apostate in the Realm of Discord with Fanatic, Legacy, SS Tachyon, and Argent Adept. &nbsp;His Apocalypse managed to help us out more than it did him as he destroyed a field full of his own demons and a Portal Fiend that had been growing pretty beefy. &nbsp;Also a proper Time Flies from the environment helped out beautifully, especially as Legacy had just played Take Down on his turn. &nbsp;With Fanatic slashing away, it wasn't long before Tachyon was set up for a double Lightspeed Barrage kill.</p><p>Unfortunatley, my boy, Argent Adept didn't get to do much. &nbsp;For the first few turns of the game he had 4 instruments and no songs, then by the time he had songs, that Apocalypse wiped the board. &nbsp;Oh well, I'll have plenty of time to get lots of miles with my favorite hero.</p><p>My girlfriend is patiently waiting for the iOS version. &nbsp;I hope Apple gets their act together and approves it soon!</p>",
